  "prefLabel": "Ed 1017.11 Termination of Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1017.11 Termination of Services. If the service provider intends to terminate services to an individual receiving IL services under an IL plan, the service provider shall follow the procedures in Ed 1017.05(c)-(e) and Ed 1017.06.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
